  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7065001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Hertha",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706500101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706500101": {
            "id": "706500101",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "Greetings, Honorary Knight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500102"
            ]
          },
          "706500102": {
            "id": "706500102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Need something from me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500103"
            ]
          },
          "706500103": {
            "id": "706500103",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "I'm Hertha, Captain of the Knights of Favonius' 6th Company.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500104"
            ]
          },
          "706500104": {
            "id": "706500104",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "My apologies for not greeting you before, but things were a tad too hectic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500105"
            ]
          },
          "706500105": {
            "id": "706500105",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "Nonetheless, I've heard of your deeds from the other knights.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500106"
            ]
          },
          "706500106": {
            "id": "706500106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you in charge of?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500107"
            ]
          },
          "706500107": {
            "id": "706500107",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "Me? Well, my work mostly includes the charter and administration of our baggage train, resource management and record-keeping.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500108"
            ]
          },
          "706500108": {
            "id": "706500108",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "Simply put, I work in logistics.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500109"
            ]
          },
          "706500109": {
            "id": "706500109",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "Well, Mondstadt's present state is as you've no doubt seen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500110"
            ]
          },
          "706500110": {
            "id": "706500110",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "With the Grand Master having taken much of our manpower with him, we have since been in a constant state of short-handedness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500111"
            ]
          },
          "706500111": {
            "id": "706500111",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "At the same time, our inventory is running a surplus to match... So I'm more than willing to exchange some of it for a little hand here and there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500112"
            ]
          },
          "706500112": {
            "id": "706500112",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "But things can get complicated here in the city, so we need experienced hands to make sure that things get done properly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500113"
            ]
          },
          "706500113": {
            "id": "706500113",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "If you're willing and you've got the confidence, you're free to have a gander at it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500114"
            ]
          },
          "706500114": {
            "id": "706500114",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "With any luck, we'll take some of the burden off our Acting Grand Master's shoulders...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500115"
            ]
          },
          "706500115": {
            "id": "706500115",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "I've already sorted the available tasks out for you. The details are right here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7065002",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706500201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706500201": {
            "id": "706500201",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "What do you think? If you think you can handle these tasks, feel free to give them a go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500202"
            ]
          },
          "706500202": {
            "id": "706500202",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "If you're able to complete them successfully, the citizens will trust you more, and you'll be allowed to take on still more important work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500203"
            ]
          },
          "706500203": {
            "id": "706500203",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "As the tasks you undertake grow in importance, so too will the amount the Knights will pay you as compensation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500204"
            ]
          },
          "706500204": {
            "id": "706500204",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "After all, while you are an Honorary Knight, the citizens don't know you too well yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500205"
            ]
          },
          "706500205": {
            "id": "706500205",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "If you wish to earn their trust, you need to interact with them more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706500206"
            ]
          },
          "706500206": {
            "id": "706500206",
            "speakerId": 1663,
            "speakerName": "Hertha",
            "text": "Well, that's the long and short of it. I'll leave it to you to decide on the tasks you wish to take up."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}